{"id":"5c9291231b94811a","group":"58","path":"58/batch18/58-thm-mitchells-order.md","title":"Mitchell Order","display":"thm-mitchells-order — Mitchell Order","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-thm-mitchells-order","aliases":["58-thm-mitchells-order"],"display":"thm-mitchells-order — Mitchell Order","depends_on":["[[../batch02/58-df-zfc-lc-normal-measure-on-cardinal.md]]","[[../batch17/58-df-ordinal.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-thm-mitchells-order"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-thm-mitchells-order</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-mitchells-order — Mitchell Order"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"b22660cd0ce1252a\" href=\"?note=b22660cd0ce1252a\" title=\"../batch02/58-df-zfc-lc-normal-measure-on-cardinal.md\">../batch02/58-df-zfc-lc-normal-measure-on-cardinal.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"5582a281f15a33c2\" href=\"?note=5582a281f15a33c2\" title=\"../batch17/58-df-ordinal.md\">../batch17/58-df-ordinal.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\kappa,U,W\\in V\">\\(\\kappa,U,W\\in V\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcLcNormalMeasureOnCardinal}_S(U,\\kappa)\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcLcNormalMeasureOnCardinal}_S(U,\\kappa)\\)</span> is the imported normal-measure predicate</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{NM}_\\kappa\">\\(\\mathsf{NM}_\\kappa\\)</span> is the set of normal measures on <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\kappa\">\\(\\kappa\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Ult}(\\mathbf V,W)\">\\(\\operatorname{Ult}(\\mathbf V,W)\\)</span> is the metatheoretic class ultrapower by <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"W\">\\(W\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\triangleleft_{\\mathrm M}^{\\kappa}\">\\(\\triangleleft_{\\mathrm M}^{\\kappa}\\)</span> is the local Mitchell relation on <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{NM}_\\kappa\">\\(\\mathsf{NM}_\\kappa\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"r_\\kappa\">\\(r_\\kappa\\)</span> denotes the unique ordinal-valued rank function supplied by the well-foundedness theorem below</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Ord}\">\\(\\mathrm{Ord}\\)</span> is the metalinguistic class of ordinals, and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{meta}\">\\(\\mathrm{meta}\\)</span> marks assertions made in the surrounding class metatheory</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}normal\\text{-}measures\\text{-}at\\text{-}kappa}\\vdash\n\\mathsf{NM}_\\kappa\\coloneqq\n\\{U\\in\\mathcal P(\\mathcal P(\\kappa)):\n\\mathrm{ZfcLcNormalMeasureOnCardinal}_S(U,\\kappa)\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}normal\\text{-}measures\\text{-}at\\text{-}kappa}\\vdash\n\\mathsf{NM}_\\kappa\\coloneqq\n\\{U\\in\\mathcal P(\\mathcal P(\\kappa)):\n\\mathrm{ZfcLcNormalMeasureOnCardinal}_S(U,\\kappa)\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}mitchell\\text{-}relation}\\vdash_{\\mathrm{meta}}\nU\\triangleleft_{\\mathrm M}^{\\kappa}W\n\\leftrightarrow\nU,W\\in\\mathsf{NM}_\\kappa\n\\land U\\in\\operatorname{Ult}(\\mathbf V,W).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}mitchell\\text{-}relation}\\vdash_{\\mathrm{meta}}\nU\\triangleleft_{\\mathrm M}^{\\kappa}W\n\\leftrightarrow\nU,W\\in\\mathsf{NM}_\\kappa\n\\land U\\in\\operatorname{Ult}(\\mathbf V,W).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}mitchell\\text{-}well\\text{-}founded}\\vdash_{\\mathrm{meta}}\n\\neg\\exists\\langle U_n:n\\in\\omega\\rangle\\in(\\mathsf{NM}_\\kappa)^\\omega\\;\n\\forall n\\in\\omega\\;(U_{n+1}\\triangleleft_{\\mathrm M}^{\\kappa}U_n).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}mitchell\\text{-}well\\text{-}founded}\\vdash_{\\mathrm{meta}}\n\\neg\\exists\\langle U_n:n\\in\\omega\\rangle\\in(\\mathsf{NM}_\\kappa)^\\omega\\;\n\\forall n\\in\\omega\\;(U_{n+1}\\triangleleft_{\\mathrm M}^{\\kappa}U_n).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}mitchells\\text{-}measure\\text{-}rank}\\vdash_{\\mathrm{meta}}\n\\exists!r_\\kappa:\\mathsf{NM}_\\kappa\\to\\mathrm{Ord}\\;\\forall U\\in\\mathsf{NM}_\\kappa\\;\\Bigl(\nr_\\kappa(U)=\\sup\\{r_\\kappa(W)+1:\nW\\in\\mathsf{NM}_\\kappa\\land W\\triangleleft_{\\mathrm M}^{\\kappa}U\\}\n\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}mitchells\\text{-}measure\\text{-}rank}\\vdash_{\\mathrm{meta}}\n\\exists!r_\\kappa:\\mathsf{NM}_\\kappa\\to\\mathrm{Ord}\\;\\forall U\\in\\mathsf{NM}_\\kappa\\;\\Bigl(\nr_\\kappa(U)=\\sup\\{r_\\kappa(W)+1:\nW\\in\\mathsf{NM}_\\kappa\\land W\\triangleleft_{\\mathrm M}^{\\kappa}U\\}\n\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}mitchells\\text{-}order}\\vdash_{\\mathrm{meta}}\no_{\\mathrm M}(\\kappa)&amp;\\coloneqq\n\\sup\\{r_\\kappa(U)+1:U\\in\\mathsf{NM}_\\kappa\\},\\\\\no_{\\mathrm M}^{\\kappa}(U)&amp;\\coloneqq r_\\kappa(U)\n\\qquad(U\\in\\mathsf{NM}_\\kappa).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}mitchells\\text{-}order}\\vdash_{\\mathrm{meta}}\no_{\\mathrm M}(\\kappa)&amp;\\coloneqq\n\\sup\\{r_\\kappa(U)+1:U\\in\\mathsf{NM}_\\kappa\\},\\\\\no_{\\mathrm M}^{\\kappa}(U)&amp;\\coloneqq r_\\kappa(U)\n\\qquad(U\\in\\mathsf{NM}_\\kappa).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Mitchell order ranks normal measures by membership in one another's ultrapowers.  With the displayed convention, <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"o_{\\mathrm M}(\\kappa)=0\">\\(o_{\\mathrm M}(\\kappa)=0\\)</span> means that there is no normal measure on <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\kappa\">\\(\\kappa\\)</span>; measurability implies <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"o_{\\mathrm M}(\\kappa)\\geq1\">\\(o_{\\mathrm M}(\\kappa)\\geq1\\)</span>.</li>\n<li>Because <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Ult}(\\mathbf V,W)\">\\(\\operatorname{Ult}(\\mathbf V,W)\\)</span> is a class ultrapower, the relation and its rank theorem are explicitly metatheoretic; they are not malformed first-order membership formulas with <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbf V\">\\(\\mathbf V\\)</span> as a set parameter.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch02/58-df-zfc-lc-normal-measure-on-cardinal.md","status":"resolved","id":"b22660cd0ce1252a","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch02/58-df-zfc-lc-normal-measure-on-cardinal.md]]","embed":false}